# Add this block to the shared Caddyfile on the Contabo server (the one in /opt/rahbar, see ba/deploy/Caddyfile),
# replacing the domain, then recreate Caddy. The nikahgator-frontend container joins Caddy's network
# (CADDY_NETWORK=rahbar_default), so Caddy reaches it by container name.
nikahgator.example.org {
	import secure
	encode gzip
	reverse_proxy nikahgator-frontend:80
}
